  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call upon your dragonmark's power to better mend wounds. When you Cast the Spell, any time you @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{Recall Knowledge (Medicine)}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.MHLuKy4nQO2Z4Am1]{Administer First Aid}, @Compendium[pf2e.feats-srd.wYerMk6F1RZb0Fwt]{Battle Medicine}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.TC7OcDa7JlWbqMaN]{Treat Disease}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.KjoCEEmPGTeFE4hh]{Treat Poison}, or @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.1kGNdIIhuglAjIp9]{Treat Wounds} you gain a +1 status bonus to the skill or perception used for the roll. This bonus remains as long as you @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.3f5DMFu8fPiqHpRg]{Sustain a Spell}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You do not need to sustain Healer's Intuition.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The bonus increases to +3.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\">@UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-effects.YyqWgONXD413hkLP]{Spell Effect: Healer's Intuition}</p>"
    },
